<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Simple event RSVPs with secret links and no signup.">
  <meta proof="proven.lol/2c6614">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico">
  <link rel="me" href="https://mastodon.nervesocket.com/@ThaMunsta">
  <title>Easy RSVP | RSVP | NerveSocket</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/home.css">
    </head>
<body>
  <header class="top">
    <a class="brand" href="/">nervesocket<span>_</span></a>
    <nav>
              <a href="/wall/">Wall</a>
              <a href="/about/">About</a>
            <a href="https://mastodon.nervesocket.com/">Mastodon</a>
      <a href="https://discord.gg/AJCTtKNzgn">Discord</a>
    </nav>
  </header>
<main class="app">    <section class="hero">
      <h1>RSVPs without<br><em>the signup.</em></h1>
      <p>Create an event, get a secret link, and share invites. No accounts, nothing to remember - just bookmark the page!</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="/rsvp/create">Create an event</a></p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><h3>Secret links</h3><p>Every event, guest and signup page has its own unguessable URL.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Email or share</h3><p>Email invites straight from the page, or copy each guest's link.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Public signup</h3><p>Optionally open a link anyone can use to RSVP.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Guest suggestions</h3><p>Let trusted guests suggest friends. You approve every one.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    </main><script src="/assets/rsvp.js"></script>  <footer class="bottom">
    <p>&copy; 2026 NerveSocket &middot; <a href="https://ko-fi.com/thamunsta">Leave a tip</a></p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
